# Pairs with NoKeyLost. The saga acknowledges its caller before it has recorded
# the commit decision or delivered a terminal, so an acknowledged batch is not
# visible on its owner.
MODULE: NoKeyLostAckBeforeDecision
TARGET: NoKeyLost
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the caller is acknowledged before the decision is recorded
PERTURBS: SagaComplete

--- FIND
SagaComplete ==
    /\ sg = "decided"
    /\ TermTargets \subseteq told
--- REPLACE
SagaComplete ==
\* MUTATION: completion does not wait for the decision or the broadcast.
    /\ sg \in {"exec", "decided"}
--- END

--- FIND
                    IF dec = "committed" /\ c \in AckCopies(bound) THEN Max(ackOn[c][k], SagaV) ELSE ackOn[c][k]]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the caller is acknowledged whatever the decision.
                    IF c \in AckCopies(bound) THEN Max(ackOn[c][k], SagaV) ELSE ackOn[c][k]]]
--- END